<title>USA: U.S. meat output up 1.0 pct from week ago-USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output up 1.0 pct from week ago-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, Jan 18, rose 1.0 pct at 814.9 million lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>18-Jan-97	489.0     6.9	315.0     4.0	814.9</p>
<p>11-Jan-97	484.0     6.7	312.0     4.1	806.8</p>
<p>Change:	    1.0%    3.0%	 1.0%   -2.4%	 1.0%</p>
<p>20-Jan-96	488.9     7.0	329.9     4.9	830.7</p>
<p>Change:	    0.0%   -1.4%	-4.5%  -18.4%	-1.9%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     1203.8    16.3	777.9     9.9     2007.9</p>
<p>1996 YTD:     1414.1    18.8	988.5    13.9     2435.3</p>
<p>Change:	  -14.9%  -13.3%     -21.3%  -28.8%     -17.6%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>18-Jan-97     723,000	   34,000     1,678,000	61,000</p>
<p>11-Jan-97     713,000	   33,000     1,652,000	63,000</p>
<p>Change:	   1.4%	     3.0%	    1.6%	 -3.2%</p>
<p>20-Jan-96     688,000	   33,000     1,765,000	78,000</p>
<p>Change:	   5.1%	     3.0%	   -4.9%	-21.8%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:   1,788,000	   82,000     4,133,000     153,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*  1,986,000	   89,000     5,275,000     220,000</p>
<p>Change:	 -10.0%	    -8.0%	  -21.6%	-30.4%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions</p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS   HOGS  SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>18-Jan-97    Est    1154	  347	   258	  131</p>
<p>11-Jan-97    Est    1162	  355	   260	  131</p>
<p>20-Jan-96    Actual 1193	  356	   257	  127</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>18-Jan-97    Est     680	  206	   188	   65</p>
<p>11-Jan-97    Est     682	  207	   189	   65</p>
<p>20-Jan-96    Actual  714	  218	   187	   63</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>04-Jan-97    46.8%	  30.4%	21.4%	  1.3%</p>
<p>06-Jan-96    50.1%	  29.4%	19.1%	  1.5%</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	    SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>04-Jan-97	  96.5%		   2.9%	   0.6%</p>
<p>06-Jan-96	  96.0%		   3.4%	   0.6%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions.</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 YTD reflects six production days.</p>
<p>1997 YTD reflects four production days</p>
</text>
